          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is LTK?",
            "answer": "<p>LTK is the biggest shopping platform created by and for creators. It allows brands and creators to work together through shoppable content. Creators earn money by showing products from partner brands and they get a commission when followers buy through their link.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_efiegQ": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is there a fee?",
            "answer": "<p>No, joining LTK is entirely <strong>free</strong> <strong>of charge</strong>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_AWtiKU": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can anyone join LTK?",
            "answer": "<p>To monetise your social media with LTK, you need to be an approved Creator. LTK accepts applications from those with consistent content and a growing, engaged audience. </p><p>Typically, this means you need over <strong>5,000</strong> <strong>followers</strong>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_7TeUkE": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I get sales on LTK?",
            "answer": "<p>Add your LTK commission link to your social posts. If someone clicks it and buys a William Wood product, you earn a commission.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_R89NXR": {
